-- title:
--   A publication without committed proper ancestor carries a bootstrap configuration as last committed configuration
-- statement:
--   For all `P`, every cluster `W` with `Inv P W` and every sent publication `W.sent (.publishRequest src s pt pv)` such that every committed `(ft, fv)` with `Descends W ft fv s.term s.version` equals `(s.term, s.version)` (the publication has no committed proper ancestor): `P.initConfs s.lastCommittedConfiguration`.
